@startuml seq-close-conversation
' Context: navigation
' Profile: client
' Command: CloseConversation / LeaveGroupConversation
' Revision: 2026-07-27

title seq-close-conversation — back mobile / chiudi chat

actor Utente
participant "UI" as UI
participant "NavigationMachine" as Nav
participant "AccountViewState" as VS

Utente -> UI : back / chiudi chat
UI -> Nav : CloseConversation\n(o BackToGroupHome)
Nav -> Nav : InvalidateConversationScope
alt account utente
  Nav -> VS : showInboxOnMobile
  Nav --> UI : InboxVisible
else account gruppo
  Nav -> VS : backToGroupHome
  Nav --> UI : GroupHomeVisible
end

@enduml
